# Dormant Powers Dislodged (jeuno 136), the draw's edge and the update's quest: a level 86 Warrior with the Limit Breaker
# at cap 90, the three earlier limit breaks completed, available. itemWanted 1 (a GM, before login: index 0): no draw,
# 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0); itemWanted -1 (a GM: index -2, below 0): a draw, itemWanted set to the index + 1, 10045
# (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, drawn). Beat Around the Bushin completed (a GM): update 8 answers updateEvent(1).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventUpdate/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=86
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 90
quest Jeuno.NewWorldsAwait completed
quest Jeuno.ExpandingHorizons completed
quest Jeuno.BeyondTheStars completed
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 1
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # itemWanted 1: no draw; 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=0
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted -1      # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # itemWanted -1: a draw; 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, drawn), itemWanted drawn + 1
finish option=0
quest Jeuno.BeatAroundTheBushin completed  # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, drawn)
update 10045 option=8                   # BATB completed: updateEvent(1)
finish option=0
